n_intro("intro — Willard<br/>Congratulations, You made planetfall in Sector-0, {player:name}. Dead rock, dead markets. I am Inspector Willard of the United Space Consumer Union Plus Plus. Your contract says you intend to establish a production concern.  I need a company name for the ledger.<br/>I need a company name before we proceed.<br/>Company name?<br/>Name..?"):::n_entity_usspinspectorwillard
    n_intro -->|"Sure thing<br/>Register the company." | n_name_provided
    n_intro -->|"Where am I? What is this? Who are you??<br/>I need answers, not forms." | n_confused
    n_intro -->|"Where is my ship?<br/>I want my ship back." | n_ship_where_intro
    n_intro -->|"Can I leave?<br/>Am I allowed to leave?" | n_leave
n_ship_where_intro("ship_where_intro — Willard<br/>Your ship is in Union impound. Safety audit, cargo manifest, standard seizure protocol. Register, and I can release it to you."):::n_entity_usspinspectorwillard
    n_ship_where_intro -->|"...Okay<br/>Fine. Back to the paperwork." | n_intro
n_leave("leave_denied — Willard<br/>Your contract specifies production and trade on this rock. We are incentevised but not obliged to set you up for trade and production, nothing more. You can file a complaint with the void, or get to work."):::n_entity_usspinspectorwillard
    n_leave -->|"Fine. Register me<br/>Register me." | n_name_provided
    n_leave -->|"I'm not registering<br/>I'm not registering." | n_decline_registration
n_confused("confused — Willard<br/>You are on a dead planet with a live mortgage. The United Space Consumer Union Plus Plus owns the trade routes and the courts. I am what stands between you and market access"):::n_entity_usspinspectorwillard
    n_confused -->|"Alright, fine<br/>Alright. Let's do it." | n_name_provided
    n_confused -->|"I'm not part of your shitty union<br/>I'm not part of your union." | n_decline_registration
    n_confused -->|"Can we just not have a name for our company?<br/>Can we skip the name for now?" | n_explain_registration
n_decline_registration("decline_registration — Willard<br/>Then you are an unlicensed operator. No registry, no trade routes. The Union does not punish; it prices."):::n_entity_usspinspectorwillard
    n_decline_registration -->|"Oh.. I see, in that case.. Where do I sign?<br/>Where do I sign?" | n_name_provided
    n_decline_registration -->|"Prefer to not provide a name<br/>I still don't want to name it." | n_explain_registration
    n_decline_registration -->|"I'll figure it out myself. Goodbye<br/>I'll figure it out myself." | n_change_mind
n_change_mind("change_mind — Willard<br/>The wasteland is vast and the Union is patient. When you tire of independence, the paperwork is here."):::n_entity_usspinspectorwillard
    n_change_mind -->|"Call me if you change your mind<br/>...Right. Let's just register." | n_name_provided
n_explain_registration("explain_registration — Willard<br/>A name is how the market finds you, how the tax ledger binds you, and how we align you. If you insist on anonymity, I can register you as a provisional entity under &quot;Provisional Concern&quot;. You can rename later"):::n_entity_usspinspectorwillard
    n_explain_registration -->|"Alright, fine<br/>Alright, give me a proper name." | n_name_provided
    n_explain_registration -->|"Yes, put me down without a name<br/>Provisional is fine." | n_intent
n_name_provided("name_provided — Willard<br/>State your company name for the Union ledger. Keep it short and legal. We can change the records later if you like."):::n_entity_usspinspectorwillard
    n_name_provided -->|"Enter company name<br/>Register us as {input:companyName}." | n_intent
n_intent("intent — Willard<br/>Intent of operation. What is the purpose of your venture {player:name} of {runtime:team:title}?"):::n_entity_usspinspectorwillard
    n_intent -->|"Build a salty empire<br/>Empire. Profits. Longevity." | n_ship_prompt
    n_intent -->|"Make piles of salt<br/>Salt. Mountains of it." | n_ship_prompt
    n_intent -->|"Pay my debts<br/>Debt first. Ambition later." | n_ship_prompt
    n_intent -->|"Make the best production lines this system has ever seen<br/>I build machines that outlive their creators." | n_ship_prompt
    n_intent -->|"No idea<br/>Still figuring it out." | n_ship_prompt
n_ship_prompt("ship_prompt — Willard<br/>Your ship is in Union impound. Standard procedure after an unscheduled landing. It contains your cargo hold, power systems, and whatever equipment you packed. You will need it to build anything worth taxing. Ready?"):::n_entity_usspinspectorwillard
    n_ship_prompt -->|"Yes, release my ship<br/>Release it." | n_give_ship
    n_ship_prompt -->|"I have a ship?<br/>I have a ship?" | n_explain_ship
n_explain_ship("explain_ship — Willard<br/>The vessel you arrived in. Grounded permanently now—no fuel for orbit, no clearance for launch. But the hull is intact. Storage systems, power core, fabrication tools. Everything you need to bootstrap a production line. Without it, you start with nothing. This rock is barren—no ore, no organics, no salvage."):::n_entity_usspinspectorwillard
    n_explain_ship -->|"Release my ship<br/>Release it." | n_give_ship
    n_explain_ship -->|"I'll be fine without one, thanks<br/>I'll manage without it." | n_decline_ship
n_decline_ship("decline_ship — Willard<br/>Bold. Without that hull you have no storage, no power core, no tools. Just dust and determination. The impound lot does not charge storage fees. Yet."):::n_entity_usspinspectorwillard
    n_decline_ship -->|"On second thought, release my ship<br/>Release it." | n_give_ship
n_give_ship("give_ship — Willard<br/>Releasing impound hold. Your ship will be delivered to your designated landing zone. [Placeholder: ship delivery pending implementation]"):::n_entity_usspinspectorwillard
    n_give_ship -->|"Thank you<br/>Thank you." | n_end
n_end("end — Willard<br/>Welcome to the ledger, {runtime:team:title}. Your success is now taxable. Begin production, establish a trade loop, and keep your receipts. I will return when the Union wants its cut."):::n_entity_usspinspectorwillard



